    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The room is White, the boxes are White, the Floor is White, can you find your way to the coloured rooms and escape the mind bending 4 dimensional maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game focuses on moving through a world in 3D but carefully constructed to simulate a 4D space. Many secret achievements can be found featuring rabbits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Xbox Controller Support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4D Maze.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secrets that lead to achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full Ray Tracing support even without high end hardware.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rabbits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Re-playability, you may not experience every part of the game on one playthrough.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A game made in Wales.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The room is White, the boxes are White, the Floor is White, can you find your way to the coloured rooms and escape the mind bending 4 dimensional maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game focuses on moving through a world in 3D but carefully constructed to simulate a 4D space. Many secret achievements can be found featuring rabbits. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Xbox Controller Support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4D Maze.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Secrets that lead to achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Full Ray Tracing support even without high end hardware.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rabbits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Re-playability, you may not experience every part of the game on one playthrough.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A game made in Wales.</p>",
    "short_description": "A 4D first person platformer. Dodge the obstacles complete the challenges. Escape!",
